 kit ready - marks a draft pull request ready for review

   <number>       the pull request to mark; default: this checkout's, which on a CI runner is the
                  one the run builds, as the CI system or the forge names it, and else the open one
                  on the branch checked out

   one of
   --report       the report, which kit ready writes into the pull request's body before it marks it
   --report-file  a file that holds the report, relative to the current directory


 kit ready
